                          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                          "width": 718,
                          "content": "DevFest.cz 2026 takes place on 30 October 2026 at Uhelný Mlýn — a converted industrial mill in Libčice nad Vltavou, just outside Prague — fully in person. Registration opens at 8:00, the keynote starts at 9:00, and the day runs through the closing lightning talks into the afterparty. Capacity is strictly capped to keep the day focused, so grab a ticket early.",
