                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": 636,
                  "content": "DevFest.cz 2026 is organised by GUG.cz, z.s. (formerly GDG Czech Republic), a registered association (zapsaný spolek) and the data controller for the personal data described here. For privacy-related enquiries, contact us at devfest@gug.cz.",
