                  "letterSpacing": 2.2
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "z4nUZ",
                  "name": "p",
                  "fill": "$ink",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": 636,
                  "content": "When you submit your email address via the notification form, we store it in SmartEmailing (our email service provider) to send you conference updates such as ticket availability announcements and event news. Legal basis: consent (GDPR Art. 6(1)(a)). You may unsubscribe at any time via the link in every email.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.85,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-body",
                  "fontSize": "$fs-body",
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "y9t14",
                  "name": "H3",
                  "fill": "$ink-soft",
                  "content": "B) ANALYTICS",
                  "fontFamily": "$font-mono",
                  "fontSize": "$fs-label",
                  "fontWeight": "normal",
                  "letterSpacing": 2.2
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "cMr49",
                  "name": "p",
                  "fill": "$ink",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": 636,
                  "content": "We use Google Firebase Analytics (measurement ID G-L5NK2S2EZ0) to understand how visitors use the site, so we can improve it. It runs only if you accept analytics cookies in the cookie banner.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.85,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-body",
                  "fontSize": "$fs-body",
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "v6sfo",
                  "name": "p",
                  "fill": "$ink",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": 636,
                  "content": "Before you decide, and if you decline: analytics does not run. The site loads no Google Analytics code, sets no analytics cookie, and sends Google no measurement data about your visit.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.85,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-body",
                  "fontSize": "$fs-body",
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "IrWw3",
                  "name": "p",
                  "fill": "$ink",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": 636,
                  "content": "If you accept: analytics loads and sets the _ga cookies listed below, which give you a random analytics identifier. That lets us count returning visitors and follow sessions across pages — pages visited, session duration, browser type. We never collect your name, email, or any other information that identifies you personally. Legal basis: consent (GDPR Art. 6(1)(a)). You can withdraw consent at any time by clicking \"Decline\" in the cookie banner (clear your browser storage to see it again).",
                  "lineHeight": 1.85,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-body",
                  "fontSize": "$fs-body",
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "Ok8IP",
                  "name": "p",
                  "fill": "$ink",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": 636,
                  "content": "Alongside page views we also record a few interaction events: opening the ticket checkout, completing a newsletter sign-up or a ticket purchase, and submitting a company invoice request. These record the action itself — which ticket wave, its price, how many tickets — and never your name, email, company details, or anything else that identifies you.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.85,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-body",
                  "fontSize": "$fs-body",
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "fHMBi",
                  "name": "p",
                  "fill": "$ink",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": 636,
                  "content": "The data is used only for analytics — never for advertising, ad personalisation, or profiling.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.85,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-body",
                  "fontSize": "$fs-body",
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "ZdSNz",
                  "name": "H3",
                  "fill": "$ink-soft",
                  "content": "C) SERVER LOGS",
                  "fontFamily": "$font-mono",
                  "fontSize": "$fs-label",
                  "fontWeight": "normal",
                  "letterSpacing": 2.2
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "D8AkMX",
                  "name": "p",
                  "fill": "$ink",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": 636,
                  "content": "Our hosting provider (Firebase Hosting) automatically records standard access logs (IP address, browser, requested URL). These are retained for up to 30 days for security purposes. Legal basis: legitimate interests (GDPR Art. 6(1)(f)).",
                  "lineHeight": 1.85,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-body",
                  "fontSize": "$fs-body",
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "mS8WJ",
                  "name": "H3",
                  "fill": "$ink-soft",
                  "content": "D) BOT PROTECTION (RECAPTCHA)",
                  "fontFamily": "$font-mono",
                  "fontSize": "$fs-label",
                  "fontWeight": "normal",
                  "letterSpacing": 2.2
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "Qvshc",
                  "name": "p",
                  "fill": "$ink",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": 636,
                  "content": "To protect our ticketing data from automated scraping and abuse, the site uses Google reCAPTCHA Enterprise (via Firebase App Check). reCAPTCHA runs in the background to tell humans from bots, analysing signals such as your interactions with the page, device and browser information, and IP address. This data is shared with Google and processed under the Google Privacy Policy and Terms of Service. Because this is a security measure, it runs regardless of your cookie choice. Legal basis: legitimate interests (GDPR Art. 6(1)(f)).",
                  "lineHeight": 1.85,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-body",
                  "fontSize": "$fs-body",
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "K3mdou",
                  "name": "H3",
                  "fill": "$ink-soft",
                  "content": "E) COMPANY INVOICE REQUESTS",
                  "fontFamily": "$font-mono",
                  "fontSize": "$fs-label",
                  "fontWeight": "normal",
                  "letterSpacing": 2.2
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "Stj9k",
                  "name": "p",
                  "fill": "$ink",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": 636,
                  "content": "If you request a company invoice via the company invoice form, we collect your company name, registration number (IČO), VAT identification number (DIČ, if provided), billing address (street, city, ZIP, country), contact email, and the number of tickets requested. We use this data to issue the invoice, process your payment, and send you a discount code to claim your tickets on ti.to. The request is stored in Google Firestore, the invoice is issued through iDoklad, and the discount code is created in ti.to. Legal basis: performance of a contract (GDPR Art. 6(1)(b)) and compliance with our legal accounting and tax obligations (GDPR Art. 6(1)(c)). Issued invoices and related accounting records are retained for up to 10 years, as required by Czech tax and accounting law.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.85,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-body",
                  "fontSize": "$fs-body",
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
            },
